arts of the country have basically ~free real estate\n+\npoor nationwide income growth\n=\nnationwide nominal price discipline\n\n\"Depopulation\" and \"weak income growth\" may themselves be related! https://t.co/o4mtTfItmW","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2110048344601137509"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-13T16:23:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110043783199133843"],"id":"2110043783199133843","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3778,"like_count":39,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":16,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110023828202283205","type":"quoted"}],"text":"genuinely confused what the quality of life measure is here. on what planet does Buffalo afford similar quality of life (setting aside cost) as Dan Diego or Honolulu???? https://t.co/pDQOQ8wzJ4","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2110043783199133843"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110039149994496001"]},"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-13T16:05:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110039157758443912"],"id":"2110039157758443912","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1821,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"oh no https://t.co/UutWGiWJBG","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2110039157758443912"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-13T14:48:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110019934814142812"],"id":"2110019934814142812","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2407,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109942428585320786","type":"quoted"}],"text":"So, what is the intelligence warning?\n\nIs use humint that good? Or is it our spy satellites? What is it exactly that enables us to warn Ukraine?\n\nIf it's satellites-- that's cheap nowadays right? Couldn't Ukraine just hire Elon to put some satellites over major Russian ballistic https://t.co/c7mQJRyi27","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2110019934814142812"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-13T14:42:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110018467042627857"],"id":"2110018467042627857","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2561,"like_count":31,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109991698608599260","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Actually AI reporting your planned crimes to the cops is a very good thing. https://t.co/eVnGwwTCWa","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2110018467042627857"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-13T14:42:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110018252818592037"],"id":"2110018252818592037","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1220,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110017715604008993","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Regardless of the general happiness of the household (measured by parental happiness), yeeting your teen outside more is good for their happiness.\n\n(until it's &gt;10 hours a week at which point idk maybe.... check in on them?) https://t.co/m176TZMe8v","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2110018252818592037"},{"author_id":"626660983","created_at":"2026-10-13T14:07:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110009420948086961"],"id":"2110009420948086961","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":2124,"like_count":36,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109679354544279750","type":"quoted"}],"text":"all possible coalitions here are truly nuts\n\nthe only quasi-rational one is, of course, AfD+CDU, but that would require a massive shift in intra-right feuding behavior https://t.co/HWkLYlgLUm","url":"https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2110009420948086961"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109991085275504640","3_2109991085241946112","3_2109991139726020608"]},"author_id":"34743251","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:56:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109991777361101135"],"id":"2109991777361101135","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":763,"impression_count":676541,"like_count":13286,"quote_count":251,"reply_count":516,"retweet_count":1632},"text":"Falcon 9 launches the CRS-35 mission to the @Space_Station https://t.co/QiHIqlDLTH","url":"https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2109991777361101135"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109988884872380416"]},"author_id":"21436960","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:46:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109989150237606400"],"id":"2109989150237606400","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":32,"impression_count":18223,"like_count":575,"quote_count":12,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":112},"text":"Launching on 19 October, @JAXA_en's Martian Moons eXploration (MMX) mission will attempt a world-first sample return from Mars’s moon Phobos. We're contributing deep-space communication technology and ground station support to help make the mission possible.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/ID7BpbRAj1","url":"https://x.com/esa/status/2109989150237606400"},{"author_id":"19355829","created_at":"2026-10-13T11:48:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109974630396285181"],"id":"2109974630396285181","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3570,"like_count":34,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":2},"text":"LAUNCH at 0028 UTC Oct 13 of Starlink Group 15-25 from Vandenberg LAUNCH at 1033 UTC Oct 13 of cargo mission Dragon CRS-35 on Falcon 9 from Canaveral","url":"https://x.com/planet4589/status/2109974630396285181"},{"author_id":"34743251","created_at":"2026-10-13T11:02:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109958876971860291","2109962954762527179"],"id":"2109962954762527179","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":44,"impression_count":863267,"like_count":3474,"quote_count":20,"reply_count":109,"retweet_count":265},"text":"Dragon separation confirmed. Autonomous docking with the @Space_Station on Thursday, October 15 at ~11:00 a.m. ET","url":"https://x.com/SpaceX/status/2109962954762527179"},{"au